{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act11d0_level_act11d0_08_beg",
  "groupId": "act11d0",
  "stageId": "act11d0_08",
  "title": "月光沉沦",
  "storyCode": "TW-8",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act11d0/level_act11d0_08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a8b694b0ae7fdec0429d5c11a0a6ec28a325663657b4324cd860135db162feb1",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "九尾狐活动 8上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民A",
      "text": "塔佳娜！最后一个“留声机”被破坏了！我们没有手段对付那些巨人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民B",
      "text": "欸！那些暴徒开始烧房子了！该死，他们......火势在蔓延！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民B",
      "text": "喂，塔佳娜，塞弗林呢！这种关键时候，他在哪里！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "塞弗林长官他......他受了伤，他正在休息......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民A",
      "text": "都什么时候了还休息！？我们可是冒着生命危险——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民B",
      "text": "闭嘴！现在不是吵架的时候，没看我们处于劣势吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民A",
      "text": "那你的法术有用吗！？废物！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "别、别吵了！控制好各自的管辖区域，防御性的源石技艺必须保证——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民B",
      "text": "东边！东边的术师倒下了！快换一个顶上！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "小心——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民A",
      "text": "火——！火烧过来了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民B",
      "text": "救——救命啊啊啊——啊啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民A",
      "text": "快、快灭火！有没有可以灭火的术师！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民B",
      "text": "救——疼，疼啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民B",
      "text": "塔佳娜——救——我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "啊......啊啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "清晰的字句很快被单纯的惨叫遮掩。\n皮肤烤焦的味道，比任何恶劣的玩笑都要让人胆寒。\n被火焰包裹着的人逐渐失去形貌，只留下黑影似的肉体......\n焦黑的皮肤和血，他挣扎着开口——\n他很痛苦，他请求我帮助他。\n但是——\n但是——托尔当时，也是这样痛苦的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "text": "塔佳娜！！别恍神了，你离太远了！小心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "text": "好机会！你也一起被烧死吧！贵族的宠物！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "text": "混乱。这座城镇从来都不是上下一心的，就像蛋糕，切成一块一块。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "text": "现在，那最后的一块也将要变成一盘散沙，他们毫无力量。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "text": "就算我们收手，就算我们撤退，他们当真能活下来吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "text": "莱塔尼亚必然会弃他们于不顾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "text": "离这里最近的两座移动城邦，二十四座高塔，没有一个大人物能俯瞰到冬灵山脉里垂死挣扎的小城镇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "——悲哀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "我们曾是厌倦了这种悲哀，而站在这里，不要忘了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "不要试图自作主张。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "text": "......当然。诶，你平时怎么不这么讲话呢？我只是抱怨抱怨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "text": "抱怨我们等待隐忍了那么久，最后的结果也没什么变化，事情还是变得很糟糕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "text": "只是一点不甘心的......牢骚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "text": "他们要冲进来了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "——唔！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "我，我来帮忙！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "text": "该死！好不容易轰开的缺口！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "text": "那个沃尔珀是哪儿来的！？她、她怎么有九条尾巴？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "text": "不对！你也是感染者！你为什么要站在那里！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "text": "这么小的年纪——你的不幸和痛苦，难道就不该反抗吗！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "text": "同胞！反抗他们！不要被骗了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "text": "他们才是压榨我们欺压我们的罪人啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "text": "呃？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "你——在说什么啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "text": "把、把他们给震飞了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "text": "她周围的源石技艺反应变慢了？这是哪个国家的法术，书上没有教过......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "不要随便就决定别人的命运啊，罗德岛的前辈们，还有爸爸妈妈，大家都对我很好啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "还有你们！不要偷偷溜过去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "text": "唔——！？身、身体......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "唔——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "不要——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "——总是不顾后果地让事情变成最坏的情况啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "......现在你打算怎么做？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "text": "毕德曼......罪魁祸首已经死了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "断崖和卡达回来之前，我们还没有确实的证据......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "text": "......那么真凶到底是谁？在我眼前发生的是什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "现在没空讨论这个问题，至少先镇压这场暴乱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "——亚叶？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "text": "我......我不知道该怎么做......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "......我理解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "一个救治感染者的医师，却死在感染者暴乱之中的那种荒唐和无力感......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "我曾比任何人......都为之愤恨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "唔——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "为什么、为什么一定要这样？大家不都知道现在的情况吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "自相残杀没有好处！大家会一起遭殃的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "text": "给我让开！否则就算你是小孩，我也不会让你好受的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "——我不！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "你们应该听我说——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "text": "那你想说什么？要从头开始梳理谁对谁错吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "text": "你觉得是什么把我们逼到这个份上的？时代、国家、人心，什么都很糟糕，自以为有些想法的人都会这么说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "text": "可是，假如现在你走在路上，有一个暴徒持刀拦路，逼问你他该如何活下去——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "text": "这个时候你要从哪里说起？从莱塔尼亚的腐败制度，还是雷姆必拓的血腥开拓？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "text": "不！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "呃——！快要支撑——不住——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "text": "他想的是怎么杀了你开辟一条生路，而你想的是要立刻开火还是想办法拉开距离再开火——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "text": "想要活下去的大部分时候，事实就这么简单。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "text": "总有一些渺小的人要牺牲，恰好都是我们这样的人，而不是你们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "text": "你们高枕无忧，畅谈理想，谴责时代，把话题变大，把敌人变遥远，来逃避近在眼前的问题——哈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "text": "——有效果了！继续冲击防线！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "......可大家都是无辜的......感染者也不是自己乐意才......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "text": "无辜？呸，我才不想取得同情，我们都不是无辜的。去他妈的吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "text": "我们只是要活下去，哪怕让其他人活不下去，在活命这方面，没有人是搞慈善的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "text": "喂！那个沃尔珀好像快不行了，九条尾巴的那只！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "text": "赶紧瞄准她！快！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "text": "噫——法、法杖断了？从哪儿来的弩箭！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "我们来帮忙了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "断崖和卡达应该在外围疏散被卷入的民众，至于我们就——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "——亚叶？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "text": "......整合运动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "text": "我确实听见，人群之中有在高喊，整合运动解放了他们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "但他们不是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "text": "不——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "text": "失去了主心骨，这场暴乱自会瓦解！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "text": "说到底，要不是因为他们，安托怎么会——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "亚叶！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "text": "冷静点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "text": "......抱歉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "text": "这对你来说并不是第一次了，对我来说......也一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "text": "我有点......不知所措。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "text": "......上吧，罗德岛要想办法阻止这场暴乱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "text": "......是罗德岛，你寄予厚望的，就是这几个孩子而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "text": "他们还不成熟，他们没来得及阻止这一切，已经晚了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "......但他们，已是战士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "text": "嚯——？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "战士，已经走上了战场。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "让其他人退下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "我们上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萨卡兹一把扯下了整合运动的标志，她扬起手，岩石瓦解，又再度汇聚。\n战场陷入寂静，暴乱者们自觉地让出道路，抗争者则因为胆怯而后退。\n只见她向前，迈出了一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
